<view class="page"
  ><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="local-banner"
    >本地演练 · 图片审核结果为模拟结果</view
  ><view class="eyebrow">把拿手的味道记下来</view
  ><view class="title">{{dishId?'编辑菜谱':'一道拿手菜'}}</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="note">{{error}}</view
  ><block wx:elif="{{!loading}}">
    <view wx:if="{{mediaAvailable || imageId}}" class="photo-picker" bindtap="photo"
      ><image wx:if="{{imageUrl}}" src="{{imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view
        wx:else
        >＋ 拍一张菜的照片<view class="muted"
          >可不上传 · 请使用自己拍摄或有授权的图片</view
        ></view
      ></view
    >
    <view wx:if="{{!mediaAvailable}}" class="muted">照片功能准备中，可以先把食材和做法记下来。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{draftSaved}}" class="draft-note">文字草稿已暂存 · 图片与内部价格请保存后再离开</view>
    <view wx:if="{{dirty&&!draftSaved}}" class="note">草稿暂存失败，请先保存菜谱再离开。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{imageId}}" class="row"
      ><text class="muted"
        >{{imageStatus==='approved'?'图片已就绪':imageStatus==='pending'?'等待安全审核':'图片尚未就绪'}}</text
      ><button
        wx:if="{{imageStatus!=='approved'}}"
        class="link-button"
        bindtap="checkImage"
      >
        查看审核结果</button
      ><button class="link-button" bindtap="removeImage">移除图片</button></view
    >
    <view class="card"
      ><view class="label">菜名</view
      ><input
        class="input"
        maxlength="40"
        placeholder="例如：妈妈的番茄炒蛋"
        value="{{name}}"
        data-field="name"
        bindinput="input"
      />
      <view class="label">一句话介绍</view><input class="input" maxlength="80" value="{{subtitle}}" data-field="subtitle" bindinput="input" placeholder="可选，记下这道菜的特点"/><button class="link-button" bindtap="suggestSubtitle">用菜名与用时生成一句介绍</button><view class="label">原始来源链接</view><input class="input" maxlength="500" value="{{sourceUrl}}" data-field="sourceUrl" bindinput="input" placeholder="可选，完整 HTTPS 链接"/>
      <view class="form-row"
        ><text>分类</text
        ><picker
          range="{{categories}}"
          value="{{categoryIndex}}"
          bindchange="category"
          ><view>{{categories[categoryIndex]}} ›</view></picker
        ></view
      >
      <view class="form-row"
        ><text>大约需要几分钟</text
        ><input
          class="number-input"
          type="number"
          maxlength="3"
          value="{{minutes}}"
          data-field="minutes"
          bindinput="input"
      /></view>
      <view class="form-row"
        ><text>一份大约供几人分享</text
        ><input
          class="number-input"
          type="number"
          value="{{defaultServes}}"
          data-field="defaultServes"
          bindinput="input" /></view
      ><view class="label">食材</view
      ><textarea
        class="textarea"
        maxlength="600"
        placeholder="番茄、鸡蛋、葱；请写全调味料中的过敏原"
        value="{{ingredients}}"
        data-field="ingredients"
        bindinput="input"
      />
      <view class="form-row"
        ><text>食材及调味料已列完整</text
        ><switch
          checked="{{ingredientComplete}}"
          data-field="ingredientComplete"
          bindchange="toggle"
          color="#244B3B" /></view
      ><view class="label">过敏原提示</view
      ><input
        class="input"
        maxlength="200"
        placeholder="例如：鸡蛋、大豆、花生"
        value="{{allergens}}"
        data-field="allergens"
        bindinput="input"
      />
      <view class="form-row"
        ><text>适合素食</text
        ><switch
          checked="{{vegetarian}}"
          data-field="vegetarian"
          bindchange="toggle"
          color="#244B3B" /></view
      ><view class="form-row"
        ><text>有辣味</text
        ><switch
          checked="{{spicy}}"
          data-field="spicy"
          bindchange="toggle"
          color="#244B3B"
      /></view>
      <view class="label">做法</view
      ><textarea
        class="textarea tall"
        maxlength="1200"
        placeholder="把你的小诀窍也记下来吧。"
        value="{{steps}}"
        data-field="steps"
        bindinput="input"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="card"><view class="section-title">分步做法</view><input class="input" maxlength="30" value="{{stepTitle}}" data-field="stepTitle" bindinput="input" placeholder="做法标题"/><button wx:if="{{steps && !stepRows.length}}" class="link-button" bindtap="splitSteps">按换行拆成步骤</button><view wx:for="{{stepRows}}" wx:key="index" class="recipe-edit-step"><view class="row"><text>步骤 {{index+1}}</text><button class="link-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeStep">删除</button></view><textarea class="textarea" maxlength="400" value="{{item.text}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="stepInput" placeholder="写下这一步怎么做"/><image wx:if="{{item.image_url}}" class="step-image" src="{{item.image_url}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:if="{{item.image_id}}" class="row"><text class="muted">{{item.image_status==='approved'?'步骤图片已就绪':'步骤图片等待审核'}}</text><button wx:if="{{item.image_status!=='approved'}}" class="link-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="checkStepImage">查看审核结果</button><button class="link-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeStepImage">移除图片</button></view><button wx:if="{{mediaAvailable}}" class="secondary" data-step="{{index}}" bindtap="photo" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.image_id?'替换步骤图片':'添加步骤图片'}}</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="addStep" disabled="{{stepRows.length>=15}}">＋ 添加步骤</button></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="section-title">规格与口味</view><view class="muted">每道菜可选一种规格，每组口味单选；同一道菜的所有份数采用这一组合。价格沿用整道菜的内部参考价。</view><view class="label">规格</view><input class="input" value="{{variants}}" data-field="variants" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：小份、大份" maxlength="160"/><view class="label">口味属性（每行一组）</view><textarea class="textarea" maxlength="600" value="{{attributes}}" data-field="attributes" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：辣度:不辣、微辣、中辣（每组另起一行）"/></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="section-title">营养记录（选填）</view><view class="muted">请根据包装标签或可靠食材数据填写。没有来源不展示，不自动估算健康结论。</view><view class="form-row"><text>向朋友展示</text><switch checked="{{nutritionVisible}}" data-field="nutritionVisible" bindchange="toggle" color="#244B3B"/></view><input class="input" maxlength="100" value="{{nutritionSource}}" data-field="nutritionSource" bindinput="input" placeholder="数据来源，例如包装营养标签"/><input class="input" maxlength="60" value="{{nutritionBasis}}" data-field="nutritionBasis" bindinput="input" placeholder="计量依据，例如每100克"/>
<view class="form-row"><text>能量（kcal）</text><input class="number-input" type="digit" value="{{calories}}" data-field="calories" bindinput="input" placeholder="未知"/></view><view class="form-row"><text>蛋白质（g）</text><input class="number-input" type="digit" value="{{protein}}" data-field="protein" bindinput="input" placeholder="未知"/></view><view class="form-row"><text>脂肪（g）</text><input class="number-input" type="digit" value="{{fat}}" data-field="fat" bindinput="input" placeholder="未知"/></view><view class="form-row"><text>碳水（g）</text><input class="number-input" type="digit" value="{{carbs}}" data-field="carbs" bindinput="input" placeholder="未知"/></view><view class="form-row"><text>膳食纤维（g）</text><input class="number-input" type="digit" value="{{fiber}}" data-field="fiber" bindinput="input" placeholder="未知"/></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{canPrice&&variantPrices.length}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">规格内部参考价</view><view class="muted">留空沿用默认价，仅有权限的厨师可见。</view><view class="form-row" wx:for="{{variantPrices}}" wx:key="variant"><text>{{item.variant}}</text><input class="number-input" type="digit" maxlength="8" value="{{item.value}}" placeholder="默认价" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="variantPriceInput"/></view></view><view wx:if="{{canPrice}}" class="card"
      ><view class="label">厨师内部参考价（元）</view
      ><input
        class="input"
        type="digit"
        maxlength="8"
        placeholder="可不填，朋友看不到"
        value="{{price}}"
        data-field="price"
        bindinput="input"
      /><view class="muted"
        >仅作内部参考，不收款；修改不影响已发布饭局的价格。</view
      ></view
    >
    <view class="card"
      ><view class="form-row"
        ><text>允许新饭局选用</text
        ><switch
          checked="{{active}}"
          data-field="active"
          bindchange="toggle"
          color="#244B3B" /></view
      ><view class="muted">关闭后保留历史饭局中的菜谱。</view></view
    >
    <button
      class="primary"
      loading="{{busy}}"
      disabled="{{busy||!name}}"
      bindtap="save"
    >
      保存这道菜
    </button></block
  >
</view>
